# BLOCKORA_TRADE - OpenCode Rules

## 🚨 CRITICAL SECURITY RULES (ABSOLUTELY MUST FOLLOW)
1. NEVER READ .env FILE - Contains API keys and passwords. DO NOT cat, view, or read .env under ANY circumstances.
2. NEVER LOG SECRETS - Do not print or log any API keys, passwords, tokens, or credentials.
3. NEVER MODIFY .env - Configuration file is read-only for security.

## STRICT CODING RULES
1. ONE FILE AT A TIME - Only modify the specific file mentioned
2. SHOW BEFORE EDIT - Show current code before changing
3. NO EXTRA FEATURES - Do not add new features/files/dependencies
4. MINIMAL CHANGES - Smallest possible change only
5. PRESERVE LOGGING - Keep all logger calls intact
6. TEST FIRST - Explain how to test before applying
7. ROLLBACK PLAN - Provide revert command for every change

## PROJECT INFO
- Name: BLOCKORA_TRADE v1.0
- Platform: Android Termux (Ubuntu proot)
- Language: Python 3.14
- Mode: RECOMMENDATION ONLY (No Auto Trading)

## FILE STRUCTURE & PERMISSIONS
- .env - 🔒 FORBIDDEN (NEVER READ/MODIFY)
- main.py - Entry point (DO NOT MODIFY unless asked)
- config/config.json - Configuration (DO NOT MODIFY)
- data/market_data_engine.py - Angel One API (CAN MODIFY)
- data/option_chain_engine.py - Option chain (CAN MODIFY)
- data/jugaad_data_fetcher.py - NSE scraper (CAN MODIFY)
- core/ - Core modules (DO NOT MODIFY unless asked)
- analysis/ - AI engines (DO NOT MODIFY unless asked)

## CURRENT STATUS
- Angel One SmartAPI: WORKING (smartapi.angelone.in)
- Scrip Master: WORKING (cached locally)
- Option Chain: WORKS for 10 cycles, FAILS on cycle 11
- IV/Greeks: WORKING via Jugaad-data (NSE scraper)
- Telegram: WORKING but slow shutdown (16 seconds)

## KNOWN ISSUES
1. "Chain timestamp missing/invalid" on cycle 11
2. Rate limiting after ~10 API calls
3. Slow shutdown (Telegram timeout)
4. Stale data threshold too strict

